      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In partnership with Coldsnap, the Prince George Public Library invites you to join us for a kids-oriented IceJam with Edmonton-based children’s musician, Beppie! Be prepared for a performance designed to create moments of laughter, rhythm, and togetherness for kids and their families featuring catch"
