        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us at the Omineca Arts Centre for an intimate IceJam by the Cariboo’s own Sam Tudor. Now based in Toronto, we’re thrilled to welcome Sam back to the North for Coldsnap 2026. This free-to-attend performance features Tudor’s distinctive voice - a sandy, melancholic narrator delivering confessiona"
