        "@value": "Come in from the cold for an exciting IceJam at the Brunswick Street Senior Activity Centre in Prince George featuring a contemporary indie-folk take on the time-honoured fiddle-singing tradition. Aleksi Campagne was raised on stages performing alongside his mother - Canadian folk icon Connie Kaldor"
      }
