        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Experience a high-energy journey combining multi-sensory spectacle with glitter-drenched, retro-grooves. This night promises an immersive performance where theatrical visuals meet infectious yacht-pop swagger, channeling the best of the '70s and '80s soft rock. Expect driving synths, pulsing rhythms"
